      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FULL NOISE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (30.01) in a Grade 4 at Sandown. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. LAKEVIEW SNEAKY (4) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from four starts. Was out of placings last time (30.30) at The Meadows in a Grade 4/5, finishing fourth and beaten 5 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. DR. FANATICAL (8) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has finished in the money at the last three runs. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Overdue and gets his chance. AFFORDABILITY (1) is not to be discarded.",
